# Solution

## Setup

We compute $S(p) = \sum_{i=0}^{p-1} \left(\frac{V_i}{p}\right)$ where $V_i = i^3 + 6i^2 + i = i(i^2+6i+1)$ and $\left(\frac{\cdot}{p}\right)$ is the Legendre symbol (with value $0$ when $p \mid V_i$).

For each prime, I compute $V_i \bmod p$ for all $i$, check membership in the set of quadratic residues, and sum the Legendre symbols.

## $p = 5$

Quadratic residues mod 5: $\{1, 4\}$.

| $i$ | $V_i \bmod 5$ | Symbol |
|-----|---------------|--------|
| 0 | 0 | 0 |
| 1 | 8≡3 | −1 |
| 2 | 34≡4 | +1 |
| 3 | 84≡4 | +1 |
| 4 | 164≡4 | +1 |

$$S(5) = 0 - 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = \boxed{2}$$

## $p = 13$

Quadratic residues mod 13: $\{1,3,4,9,10,12\}$.

Computing $V_i \bmod 13$: $i=0\to0$; $i=1\to8$; $i=2\to8$; $i=3\to6$; $i=4\to8$; $i=5\to7$; $i=6\to9$; $i=7\to7$; $i=8\to7$; $i=9\to2$; $i=10\to1$; $i=11\to1$; $i=12\to4$.

- **+1** (QR): $i=6,10,11,12$ → 4 values
- **−1** (non-QR): $i=1,2,3,4,5,7,8,9$ → 8 values
- **0**: $i=0$

$$S(13) = 4 - 8 = \boxed{-4}$$

## $p = 17$

Quadratic residues mod 17: $\{1,2,4,8,9,13,15,16\}$.

Computing $V_i \bmod 17$: $i=0\to0$; $i=1\to8$; $i=2\to0$; $i=3\to16$; $i=4\to11$; $i=5\to8$; $i=6\to13$; $i=7\to15$; $i=8\to11$; $i=9\to12$; $i=10\to12$; $i=11\to11$; $i=12\to3$; $i=13\to11$; $i=14\to7$; $i=15\to14$; $i=16\to4$.

- **+1** (QR): $i=1,3,5,6,7,16$ → 6 values
- **−1** (non-QR): $i=4,8,9,10,11,12,13,14,15$ → 9 values
- **0**: $i=0,2$

$$S(17) = 6 - 9 = \boxed{-3}$$

## $p = 29$

Quadratic residues mod 29: $\{1,4,5,6,7,9,13,16,20,22,23,24,25,28\}$ (14 elements).

Computing $V_i = i(i^2+6i+1) \bmod 29$ for $i=0,\ldots,28$:

- **+1** (QR): $i=2,7,8,9,11,12,13,15,16,17,18,19,20,21,23,24,25,26,28$ → 19 values
- **−1** (non-QR): $i=1,3,4,5,6,10,14,22,27$ → 9 values
- **0**: $i=0$ → 1 value

Verification of counts: $19 + 9 + 1 = 29$ ✓

$$S(29) = 19 - 9 = \boxed{10}$$

## $p = 37$

Quadratic residues mod 37: $\{1,3,4,7,9,10,11,12,16,21,25,26,27,28,30,33,34,36\}$ (18 elements).

Computing $V_i = i(i^2+6i+1) \bmod 37$ for $i=0,\ldots,36$:

- **+1** (QR): $i=2,3,4,5,8,9,11,14,15,17,19,23,24,25,27,28,29,33,36$ → 19 values
- **−1** (non-QR): $i=1,6,7,10,12,13,16,18,20,21,22,26,30,31,32,34,35$ → 17 values
- **0**: $i=0$ → 1 value

Verification of counts: $19 + 17 + 1 = 37$ ✓

$$S(37) = 19 - 17 = \boxed{2}$$

## Final Sum

$$\sum_{p \in \{5,13,17,29,37\}} S(p) = 2 + (-4) + (-3) + 10 + 2 = \boxed{7}$$

